///To redirect a WordPress page to another website page//////////////////

Using a Plugin: Redirection

1. Go to WordPress Dashboard → Plugins → Add New

2. Search: Redirection

3. Install & Activate

4. Go to Tools → Redirection / click on "Manage"

5. Click "Add New"

Set:

Source URL → /old-page/

Target URL → https://example.com/new-page

Click Add Redirect

✔ Done
